            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bouncebin 1.1.3</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Settings now shows where your copies are</b>, with a button that
      opens the folder. It sits outside the app so updating or reinstalling
      never touches it — which is also why Finder hides it, and why there
      was no way to find it before.</li>
</ul>
